# REQ-006: Bot Loading & Status States
**Priority:** Must Have
**Effort:** Low
**Risk:** Low
**Depends On:** REQ-001
---
## User Story
As an external partner developer,
I need to see what the bot is doing while it processes my question,
So that I know the system is working and am not left staring at a blank screen for up to 10 seconds.
**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] While the bot is processing a response, a loading spinner is displayed in the chat interface
- [ ] When the bot is executing tool calls (e.g. searching documentation, retrieving examples), a contextual status message is shown to the user (e.g. "Searching documentation…", "Retrieving examples…")
- [ ] Status messages update in real-time as the bot progresses through tool calls
- [ ] Spinner and status messages disappear when the response is ready
- [ ] If the bot times out (>10s), a polite error message is shown: "Sorry, that's taking longer than expected. Please try again or escalate to our team."
