## Dimension 3: Security
### Applicable Guardrails
- **SEC-001:** TLS 1.2+ for all HTTP communication
- **WSEC-006a:** encodeURIComponent() for any user-supplied URL values
### Security Requirements
- **Authentication:** EMIS-X authentication required (inherited from REQ-001)
- **Authorisation:** Authenticated EMIS-X users only
- **Encryption in Transit:** TLS 1.2+
- **Encryption at Rest:** N/A — no data persisted
- **Information Leakage:** Status messages MUST NOT expose internal system details, tool names, API endpoints, or error stack traces
