## Dimension 4: Observability & Performance
### Product KPIs
- **KPI 1:** Spinner appearance latency — Target: < 300ms after question submission
- **KPI 2:** Timeout rate — Target: < 5% of requests
- **KPI 3:** Tool call duration per type — Baseline: TBD, Target: < 8s per tool call
### Observable Events (OTEL Instrumentation)
- **Span 1:** `qabot.loading.spinner.start`
  - **Attributes:** session_id, question_length, timestamp
- **Span 2:** `qabot.loading.toolcall.start`
  - **Attributes:** session_id, tool_name (sanitised), timestamp
- **Span 3:** `qabot.loading.toolcall.complete`
  - **Attributes:** session_id, tool_name (sanitised), duration_ms, status
- **Span 4:** `qabot.loading.timeout`
  - **Attributes:** session_id, elapsed_ms, timestamp
### Performance SLOs
- **Spinner appearance:** < 300ms after question submission
- **Availability:** 99.9%
- **Timeout rate:** < 5%
### Alerting Conditions
- **Critical:** Timeout rate > 10% over 5 minutes → Slack/Teams alert
- **Warning:** p95 spinner appearance > 500ms → Warning alert
